A practical n8n workflow that turns Google Sheets into the starting point for an automated contact and communication system.

Instead of manually creating contacts and sending emails, the workflow connects the process into a single automated flow.

💼 Business Problem

Businesses often collect contact information in spreadsheets but still manually:

Create contacts
Send emails
Move information between tools
Maintain contact records

This workflow removes those repetitive steps.

⚙️ What It Does

Google Sheets → n8n → Gmail → Google Contacts

When new contact information is added to the spreadsheet, n8n processes the data and automatically handles the connected actions.

🏗️ Workflow Architecture
Google Sheets
     ↓
    n8n
     ↓
Process Contact Data
     ↓
    ┌───────────────┐
    ↓               ↓
  Gmail      Google Contacts

🛠️ Tools Used
n8n
Google Sheets
Gmail
Google Contacts

🔑 Key Steps
Capture contact information in Google Sheets
Trigger the n8n workflow
Process the submitted data
Send the required Gmail communication
Create/manage the corresponding Google Contact

